  "body": "Perfectly positioned on an approximately 200sqm section, this contemporary two-level home offers an exceptional lifestyle opportunity in one of Silverdale's most desirable neighbourhoods. Designed with modern families in mind, the home combines generous proportions, quality finishes, and an abundance of natural light across its well-utilised 174sqm (approx.) floor plan.\r\nThe moment you enter, the open-plan kitchen and dining area anchors the home, offering a relaxed setting for daily life and shared moments. Finished with a modern kitchen featuring sleek cabinetry and generous bench space, it is designed to balance style with everyday practicality. Adjoining this central space, the separate lounge provides a quiet and flexible living zone - ideal for unwinding at the end of the day. This area can also be used as an additional bedroom, offering extra flexibility for the home. Flowing to the sunny outdoor deck, the home embraces a comfortable indoor-outdoor rhythm, perfect for both relaxed living and effortless entertaining.\r\nThe ground floor also includes a full bathroom, adding extra convenience for visitors or extended family stays. Completing the lower level is a single internal-access garage with an integrated laundry nook, providing practicality without compromising on space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, accommodation is both spacious and well-considered. Four generous bedrooms offer flexibility for growing families, working from home, or hosting guests. The master bedroom serves as a peaceful private retreat, featuring a walk-in wardrobe and a stylish ensuite. The remaining bedrooms are complemented by a modern family bathroom with a bathtub - ideal for busy family living.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\nCentral air-conditioning\r\nIntercom\r\n\r\nLocated in the vibrant Silverdale community, this property enjoys close proximity to Silverdale Shopping Centre, KingsWay School, Northern Arena, local cafés, parks, and just a 3-minute drive to Pak'nSave Silverdale. Well positioned for excellent motorway connections, and within easy walking distance of Hibiscus Coast Station, Park & Ride.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for your forever family home, a low-maintenance modern lifestyle, or a quality investment in a rapidly growing area, this impressive residence offers outstanding value and comfort in equal measure.\r\n\r\nYour new lifestyle starts here - contact us today to arrange a private viewing.",
